  "type_name": "看圖說話",
  "class_id": "218",
  "title": "看圖說話沒有類別",
  "source_url": "https://klokah.iformosa.com.tw/sentence/junior/learn/4/10/218",
  "dialect": "馬蘭阿美語",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": "001",
      "amis": "Maolah tayra kongkoan kako. Minanam miconga, mitilid, lomadiw, masakero. Malipahak kako to romiamiad. Makapah ko micongaan no mako. Mafanaʼay kako a mitilid, mansa maolahay ko singsi takowanan. I tini i loma’ i, o wina to, o wama, o kaka to faʼinayan, o safa to fafahiyan i, sahetoay maolah mitengil to kalomadiw no mako, minengneng to kasakero no mako.",
      "zh": "我喜歡去學校，學畫畫、讀書、唱歌、跳舞。我每天都很高興。我畫的圖很漂亮。我(也)很會讀書，老師很喜歡我。在家裡，爸爸、媽媽、哥哥、妹妹全都喜歡聽我唱歌、看我跳舞。",
      "en": "",
